          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "$$\\int_{X \\times Y} f\\,d(\\mu \\times \\nu) = \\int_X \\left(\\int_Y f_x\\,d\\nu\\right)d\\mu = \\int_Y \\left(\\int_X f^y\\,d\\mu\\right)d\\nu.$$ ",
          "uses": [
            "2.1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact": "F4",
          "source": "lem-gaussian-exponential-mixture-integral",
          "source_section": "Statement",
